# ONE IN-PROCESS SCREEN of the EXACT dependent-launch fusions (ds41-fuse, LEVERS.md "FUSE"; zzzaql's AQL-stamped c8 on int14 named the
#   sites): lever FUSE-R -- the trunk MoE router chain gemm_nt_f32 -> router_scored_topk -> moe_scatter (gaps 173 + 172 us a c8 step, on the
#   critical path) in fewer launches, each form the stock code with only the launch boundary removed: fn4 ds41_rfuse 1 = the selection and the
